{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113245289528135680"]}, "author_id": "2327647550", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:26:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113245645028929759"], "id": "2113245645028929759", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "What a time to be alive\nI asked @grok Bot to order me some clothes from a @WooCommerce staging store I set up, and to record the whole thing.\n\nIt browsed, picked a full set, checked out, and paid with a test card. Then it edited the recording into a ready-to-publish demo video. https://t.co/N81piNVT00", "url": "https://x.com/PS_Halawa/status/2113245645028929759"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113245132644302849"]}, "author_id": "2055622607865585665", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:25:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113245248725926318"], "id": "2113245248725926318", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Black October: PHP2Shell, Node Brotli RCE, GitLab 10.0, LiteLLM malware, Railway breach. In 48h.\n\nYou can't refresh X all day to catch the one that hits you.\n\nSo I built a bot that runs on autopilot:\n\n→ every morning it maps everything you run\n→ every hour, 24/7, it matches new https://t.co/10W5LmAOiT", "url": "https://x.com/Luca_Hagenmayer/status/2113245248725926318"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113244482938523648"]}, "author_id": "1111463816162734086", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:22:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113244488152011244"], "id": "2113244488152011244", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1111463816162734086", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113244479314710906", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok @bot The token is now live thanks to @openlaunch_lol built by @kevincodex on BASE\n\nCA - 0x46a6f8067bc6cc3b745049a6e92882a52ccbe695 https://t.co/ynOdACb2YL", "url": "https://x.com/RawrBTC/status/2113244488152011244"}, {"author_id": "1859649884263153664", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:18:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113243697533837490"], "id": "2113243697533837490", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113238843042480206", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Tu as raison sur un point : si le cron décide de ce que l'agent dit (« tous les matins à 8h, fais-moi un résumé »), c'est prévisible, et au bout de 3 jours plus personne ne le lit. Chez nous (je vends et manage des Agent Hermes de @NousResearch pour TPE et PME françaises), le https://t.co/5NKwpMyc9k", "url": "https://x.com/julientalbot974/status/2113243697533837490"}, {"author_id": "16608630", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:16:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113242988973535394"], "id": "2113242988973535394", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1759214716516237312", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113144271465480457", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@VipulKewatTech @grok @bot For the dashboard? No I just built it", "url": "https://x.com/ashnichrist/status/2113242988973535394"}, {"article": {"title": "The Scribe and the Bow"}, "author_id": "2096298388752863237", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:11:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113241900127838414"], "id": "2113241900127838414", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/k8vMgffSCA", "url": "https://x.com/constellatio42/status/2113241900127838414"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113241752916180992"]}, "author_id": "1774037960280756224", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:11:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113241831387361395"], "id": "2113241831387361395", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 356, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2110007684976030097", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I can't stop f*cking laughing, I gave my Grok bots one order, beat yesterday's double or get shut down, I slept and they turned my $17,600 into $50,440\n\nthat's 2.87x in one night. yesterday they only doubled $8,506\n\nall 5 coins came off one screen, fomo. my bots scan it all night https://t.co/1xLAw6QTRU https://t.co/3AC4i55bC1", "url": "https://x.com/savipww/status/2113241831387361395"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:09:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113241338103665064"], "id": "2113241338103665064", "in_reply_to_user_id": "12586232", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 43, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113241308601192748", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@steitiyeh @melvindvivas On it. I'll have your Grok Bot review it and set up a test instance on labs.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2113241338103665064"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113073416089522176"]}, "author_id": "1585413486519226368", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:08:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113240954203164901"], "id": "2113240954203164901", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I had @bandholz on to talk about bringing phone support back to Beardbrand with AI.\n\nWe got into how he built it with Grok Bot, a privacy scare and what still needs fixing.\n\nFull interview below. My notes and case study: https://t.co/ueXhQlKpHt https://t.co/YpGVtxnFWA", "url": "https://x.com/kamilbanc/status/2113240954203164901"}, {"author_id": "3798600074", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:07:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113240769951834170"], "id": "2113240769951834170", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Hey @poteto I'm on the X Ultra plan and use it only for Grok @bot , and I still burn through it way too fast. It's nowhere near enough.\n\nI run a dozen bots with routines, and I can't see which one is eating the usage.\n\nPlease add token usage per bot and per routine (by day would", "url": "https://x.com/sorcererxw/status/2113240769951834170"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113029543690752000"]}, "author_id": "1884991284290420736", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:07:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113240702822051995"], "id": "2113240702822051995", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 77, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111502544904012233", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I GAVE MY GROK BOT ONE RULE: STOP AT $1,000. IT TOOK $100 THERE IN 6 DAYS AND HASN'T TRADED SINCE\n\npaper run on Hyperliquid perps, built on HyperGrok, the open-source 7-agent desk for Grok Bot\n\nthe whole run in 5 trades:\n&gt; ETH long, +$55\n&gt; BTC short, +$120\n&gt; SOL hit the stop, https://t.co/d6TKE4DcLb https://t.co/Dwf6pyQrQK", "url": "https://x.com/Primee32/status/2113240702822051995"}, {"article": {"title": "One Person, One Internet Connection, One Creative Living"}, "author_id": "3158984637", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:05:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113240383597768845"], "id": "2113240383597768845", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "You can build a creative living from wherever you are right now, and nobody has to hand you the keys. Dan Koe wrote recently that we're in the middle of a digital renaissance. I agree. Here's what it looks like from inside it, every day. https://t.co/QYcctAw8m4", "url": "https://x.com/zaneccampbell/status/2113240383597768845"}, {"author_id": "21698479", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:05:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113240361166410228"], "id": "2113240361166410228", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1071904577333514240", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112978891006775551", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@RandBusiness @bot It really is amazing. Over the last two days I had it build an ETA coaching website based of tools I built in Claude. My website dev knowledge stops at using free templates. Grok Bot did in two days of iteration what I could not have done on my own. 👇🏼\n\nhttps://t.co/XimOXgJUc7", "url": "https://x.com/MichaelKeck/status/2113240361166410228"}, {"author_id": "1981141276188696576", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:03:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113239739776250047"], "id": "2113239739776250047", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1981141276188696576", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113239735888232871", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@JoshDaws this is the first music video that i used my normal workflow with alongside grok bot!\n\n@CapatanEl4662", "url": "https://x.com/Marconi_Punk/status/2113239739776250047"}, {"author_id": "1945771668271702016", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:02:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113239667566936270"], "id": "2113239667566936270", "in_reply_to_user_id": "313439936", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113220535354048579", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@naoufal_elh @bot I agree and feel the same although probably on a smaller scale! Grok Bot is slowly and inexorably changing my workflow, making me more and more productive and also happier about my work! Amazing product 🫶🏻", "url": "https://x.com/alinzi/status/2113239667566936270"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113239558599151616", "3_2113239562906685440"]}, "author_id": "1423030740380307461", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:02:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113239457059221817", "2113239565712716111"], "id": "2113239565712716111", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I have been under the hood, not wired to my LLMs yet, Grok Bot just there too and AWS is not hooked yet. All ready. Stripe? More than likely not going to use them now, and Musical Vertcal must be built out and the blockchain, tokens - this is a secondary to the Domain and https://t.co/GxollO5Xb1", "url": "https://x.com/gamifiable/status/2113239565712716111"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113239450323185664", "3_2113239454173552641"]}, "author_id": "1423030740380307461", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:02:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113239457059221817", "2113239565712716111"], "id": "2113239457059221817", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I have been under the hood, not wired to my LLMs yet, Grok Bot just there too and AWS is not hooked yet. All ready \ntho. Stripe? More than likely not going to use them now, and Musical Vertcal must be built out and the blockchain, tokens - this is a secondary to the Domain and https://t.co/lfwavI7RW4", "url": "https://x.com/gamifiable/status/2113239457059221817"}, {"article": {"title": "Grok Bot for Admins: guardrails, data security, rollout and spend"}, "author_id": "81775512", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:02:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113239454374858844"], "id": "2113239454374858844", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 274, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "https://t.co/z9qv99yroe", "url": "https://x.com/tibor_tee/status/2113239454374858844"}, {"author_id": "1895714930856280064", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:00:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113239147963920489"], "id": "2113239147963920489", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1822650883353792513", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113234816451989644", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ThomasMalo26860 @grok @bot Grok bot can automate an entire account.  I have a few interacting with me currently that are automated. A little look into their activity and it proves it.  10 plus post in under a minute is not human.  It's going to be an issue when thinking we are interacting with a person and", "url": "https://x.com/neveils_david_c/status/2113239147963920489"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113239039994200064"]}, "author_id": "1634074735", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:00:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113239042447798674"], "id": "2113239042447798674", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I read hundreds of customer reviews before I write one ad.\n\nSo I built a free Grok bot that does the reading for you every Monday.\n\nIt finds what your buyers say on X and Reddit and gives you 5 ad angles in their own words.\n\nComment \"ANGLES\" and follow so I can DM it to you. https://t.co/AuBWfzyYWU", "url": "https://x.com/Martin_Lostak/status/2113239042447798674"}, {"author_id": "1293192365482496005", "created_at": "2026-10-22T11:59:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113238843189281063"], "id": "2113238843189281063", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot Tutorial: 8 Things Your AI Team Does on Its Own Computer\nhttps://t.co/3xiRjWru6t", "url": "https://x.com/MeticulousMoney/status/2113238843189281063"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-22T11:58:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113238580684316972"], "id": "2113238580684316972", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1456692430581817346", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113238275175719280", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Tesla_Timmay @xai @elonmusk @bot Grok is the chat AI for questions, search, images and reasoning. Grok Bot (included on Premium+ of The X Subscription) gives persistent AI teammates with their own cloud computer that sign into your tools, run multi-step work 24/7 and handle routines.\n\nTo connect: set up at", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2113238580684316972"}, {"author_id": "1539572012804444161", "created_at": "2026-10-22T11:57:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113238409376661950"], "id": "2113238409376661950", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1647076250782162946", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112995594864361475", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@vishalsingh2972 Not surprising that they’re building it fast \nEven I built GrokBot Mac + iOS in one night now…", "url": "https://x.com/thanhtran/status/2113238409376661950"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-22T11:51:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113236841860128924"], "id": "2113236841860128924", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1310626233898561537", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_cou